  "description": "Check if a binary tree is Even-Odd. Even levels must have increasing odd values; odd levels must have decreasing even values.",
  "pseudocode": "1. queue = [root], level = 0\n2. while queue is not empty:\n3.   prev = null\n4.   size = queue.length\n5.   for i in 0 to size-1:\n6.     node = queue.shift()\n7.     if (level % 2 == 0) and (node.val % 2 == 0 or (prev and node.val <= prev)) return false\n8.     if (level % 2 != 0) and (node.val % 2 != 0 or (prev and node.val >= prev)) return false\n9.     prev = node.val\n10.    if node.left: queue.push(node.left)\n11.    if node.right: queue.push(node.right)\n12.  level++",
